Infinite Yes.

Ingredients.
1 g dough

Method.
Put dough into the mixing bowl.
Clean the mixing bowl.
Pour contents of the mixing bowl into the baking dish.
Bake the dough.
Serve with yes pie.
Bake until baked.

Yes Pie.

Ingredients.
10 ml newline syrup
121 ml yes syrup

Method.
Put newline syrup into the mixing bowl.
Put yes syrup into the mixing bowl.
Pour contents of the mixing bowl into the baking dish.
Clean the mixing bowl.

Serves 1.
